    "summary": "Female figure carved from wood [Ricinodendron africanum?] with integral circular base. The figure has a large head and upper body, smaller lower torso and legs, and arms bent at the elbows with raised fists. The face has narrow eyes, pigmneted in black and a small mouth dyed red (ngula ?). The figure has a flat, circular coiffure or hat. The whole figure is pigmented white with kaolin.",
